## 📚 Brand sources (read before writing)

All brand facts live in `.claude/skills/brand-identity/resources/`. They are synced copies of the master files in the ClearFlow Drive (`H:\My Drive\marketing\brand\`). Do not restate them here; if something is missing or wrong, fix the master in Drive and re-copy it.

| File | What it covers |
|------|----------------|
| `brand-context.md` | What ClearFlow is (automation agency, service + technology), ICP, pain points, objections and counters, value props, positioning vs. generic tools, default CTAs |
| `voice-tone.md` | Voice attributes, **channel tone and opening per channel** (pain-first vs. benefit-first), PAS and benefit-first structures, language rules, terminology, blacklist, approved patterns, CTA conventions, good/bad examples |
